{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>QuickQR Unlimited 是一款專為 iOS 而設的 QR 碼工具，把掃描、生成與紀錄管理整合於簡潔的原生介面，所有資料只留在裝置本機，不會上傳雲端。無論是分享訪客 Wi-Fi 密碼、整理社交平台連結，還是快速讀取產品條碼，都能一掃即得。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合經常需要處理 QR 碼的用戶把握機會下載。</p>\n\n<h2>掃描生成管理一站完成</h2>\n<p>QuickQR Unlimited 集極速掃描、QR 碼生成與智能紀錄於一身，全程在裝置本機運作，毋須雲端也不設追蹤。掃描反應少於 300 毫秒，支援 EAN-13 與 Code 128 條碼；生成功能可即時預覽，並匯出無水印的 PNG 或 PDF，亦可製作 Wi-Fi 連線碼與社交名片碼，方便分享網絡與聯絡資訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-246-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-247-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-248-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-249-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-250-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-251-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QuickQR Unlimited</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T19:19:27.601656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}